# Declaring a singleton makes this directory an explicit QML module, which
# turns OFF implicit sibling resolution — every type in here has to be listed
# or `Bar is not a type`. That is the whole reason this file has more than one
# line.
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Icons 1.0 Icons.qml
singleton OsdState 1.0 OsdState.qml
singleton WidgetState 1.0 WidgetState.qml
singleton BarConfig 1.0 BarConfig.qml
singleton MenuState 1.0 MenuState.qml
singleton LauncherStyle 1.0 LauncherStyle.qml
singleton PostItState 1.0 PostItState.qml
Bar 1.0 Bar.qml
Osd 1.0 Osd.qml
StartMenu 1.0 StartMenu.qml
